# Pairs with RestoredCutNotReAdvanced. The born-closed copy without the admission
# epoch: a delivery admitted before the pause that lands after the lift opened
# the restored copy is applied to it.
MODULE: RestoredCutNotReAdvancedAdmissionEpochIgnored
TARGET: RestoredCutNotReAdvanced
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the seam checks only that the copy is closed, not the admission epoch
PERTURBS: Land

--- FIND
          IN \/ p \in closed[d]
             \/ r.ep < floor[d][p]
--- REPLACE
          IN \* MUTATION: closed only.
             p \in closed[d]
--- END
